# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The agents, includes and skills here are junctioned into every project that
# uses them, so a CRLF checkout on one machine would change what each of those
# projects reads. core.autocrlf is a per-machine setting; .gitattributes
# overrides it, so the answer travels with the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows tooling that genuinely wants CRLF: cmd.exe can mis-read labels and
# goto targets in an LF batch file.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Never transformed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
